ch events?\", \"notes in Garden log notebook\", \"and Raku?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0011\", \"v\": [[\"what do i have about sculling\", \"how much was the tickets one\", \"anythin in my to-do list about it too?\"], [\"umm what've I got about sculling?\", \"oh the tickets one, how much was, uh, how much was that?\", \"and is there anything in my to-do list about it as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0013\", \"v\": [[\"Could you show me photos of Saoirse, please?\", \"Also, could you pull up my pictures from Chamonix Common?\", \"One more thing, could you please square up with all the Besness trip members who owe me?\"], [\"show me pics of Saoirse\", \"also my pics from Chamonix Common?\", \"oh and square up w everyone in the Besness trip who owes me\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0014\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me whether I deleted the hinge photo, please?\"], [\"I was looking for it earlier and couldn't find it anywhere, so did I end up deleting the hinge photo?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0015\", \"v\": [[\"umm what's still on my list?\", \"and how many of them are there, like, in total?\"], [\"Could you tell me what's still on my list, please?\", \"And how many are there altogether?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0017\", \"v\": [[\"delete the ask dunja note pls\"], [\"uh can you delete the, um, the ask dunja note?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w35-0018\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you delete the wishlist note?\", \"ok different thing, uh, can I see the Chamonix house share expenses?\", \"wait hang on, which tasks are still, um, still open?\", \"ok back to the expenses, the fifth one, which group's that in?\", \"and who's in it?\", \"oh and um, is the fresco note in the trash?\"], [\"Could you please delete the wishlist note?\", \"Could you show me the Chamonix house share expenses, please?\", \"Sorry, quick question before I forget: which tasks are still open?\", \"Going back to those expenses, could you tell me which group the fifth one is in?\", \"And who is in that group?\", \"Also, could you check whether the fr